{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-a-monologue-00", "rc": 0, "secs": 45.2, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "c127add69ffea223f73d0f9c0a5da607af639d3f254b8c0db988052be950adda", "raw_json_sha": "22355422eaefe3c7c912f75c67cdac7b7491bc118d349d717bd495b42dc60ca1", "n_tokens": 49, "text": "So the way this works is that the system first looks at your calendar, then it finds a few open slots that fit the meeting, and after that it sends invitations to everyone on the list with a short note explaining the agenda."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-a-prompt-03", "rc": 0, "secs": 35.63, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "8c2d2564a2a3a39c82300a4038b82958515498e75bb4f8b0419509e112b69be8", "raw_json_sha": "c3dba34bbd19cd19aea9fa769cb6b4f31eb42e4dea80990b5e26e20d41c9189c", "n_tokens": 8, "text": "Tell me what you need."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-a-question-10", "rc": 0, "secs": 44.76, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "37114d50f9f441798ffa46509fe9b4cb0ec165989c464e388e36218f88b91923", "raw_json_sha": "5450819bd08567b2cc9299a5c6702ed5dfa0139e2e013aaae98d9df2215d0c48", "n_tokens": 13, "text": "Would you like me to call the restaurant for you?"}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0012", "rc": 0, "secs": 44.72, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "0e3f916480ae3babe8222c95387514b0c1a49695713a4697c63f6895237b4963", "raw_json_sha": "6469201b19d2abee993779289a92194dea5b0f5c90b2f767b38e98f3da6dae94", "n_tokens": 19, "text": "If you have time this weekend, I would love to show you the new garden."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0025", "rc": 0, "secs": 40.03, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "27a76896b3141c181c6306bc78610001cadcc3da27a333779df8ec4fa50817c3", "raw_json_sha": "78305ea47cef8765bb668d4c4479777b6d0c78e926cb614c64f37ae206628aef", "n_tokens": 19, "text": "We are looking for an apartment with two bedrooms and a balcony that faces the river."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0038", "rc": 0, "secs": 41.93, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "fd8a8fd2d43c70d805415e7f3c946741fdf437cd1bf7f50580f3d79c0cca872a", "raw_json_sha": "77832074950350cbc4bfbc6f6be6ef303b3f320c93b74e3fd21ef041f0dedbd6", "n_tokens": 17, "text": "He has been working on this project since last October without any real break."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0051", "rc": 0, "secs": 41.45, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "4ed594e6beb634800846ae78d9c5d02e10fa8e60b46232cef8587af0ec4e2f6f", "raw_json_sha": "ceb6ee06d40b70eac0a0940e70398df8e9e8e09d0dcd50df86b8de358c5750e5", "n_tokens": 20, "text": "Can you find out whether the library is open on public holidays or only on weekdays?"}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0064", "rc": 0, "secs": 42.4, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "f25d27546d0c7bda667479373866abc0373d151f0b08b38c20ecf6c1e7612e44", "raw_json_sha": "bbc8c29fe51cc48e9477685dbefeed29e0fa2acc3f313b5669baac9232368282", "n_tokens": 20, "text": "I heard there is a new coffee shop on the corner of Main Street and Fifth Avenue."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0077", "rc": 0, "secs": 49.33, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "288279174fa21a7dfbe67eb65fa385f7bf54d9dcce60cb2710f30f846c4f73f2", "raw_json_sha": "8cc22776ec77f355a4a7e47ccb06f0b5ba938e3a3d477dcbcf861215fd7bcf70", "n_tokens": 17, "text": "Just a second. That price looks far too high for a single night."}
{"label": "exp2_w_t1_default", "clip": "rec-u-0090", "rc": 0, "secs": 50.89, "threads": 1, "cpus": "28", "env": {}, "canon_sha": "0464f3106e7524efbf26d71543fc9c5dc691082a57d2e7f556658801a2b7d07c", "raw_json_sha": "25d68ad4aebd2fdaafff191b833bfa4ad1d52dfb88029236b9e588ac773272a2", "n_tokens": 5, "text": "All right."}
